rk3588-board-orangepi-5b (0.1.3-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Ship our own rk3588s-orangepi-5b.dtb (upstream DTS + the 5B hunk of
    kernel patch 0006) so stock kernels get AP6275P WiFi and Bluetooth.
  * Package AP6275P WiFi/BT firmware (incl. BCM4362A2.hcd), fetching it
    from armbian/firmware when overlay/firmware is absent.
  * Drop the vendor-kernel panthor-gpu overlay from u-boot defaults; the
    stock and packaged DTBs already enable the GPU for panthor.
  * Load ledtrig_heartbeat at boot so the status LED blinks on stock kernels.
  * Keep the HYM8563 32k LPO on before PCIe link training via a
    regulator-fixed-clock supply chain, so the AP6275P WiFi enumerates.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

